flowchart LR
  Partner[Non-login Partner/Proponent] -->|documents or referral outside system| PARAYA[PARAYA staff]
  PARAYA --> Registry[Partner Registry]
  Registry --> Terms[Agreement and renewal records]
  PARAYA --> History[Historical Program Intake]
  History --> Review[Human provenance and quality review]
  Researcher[Researcher] -->|confirms evidence| Proposal[Structured Proposal]
  Associate[Associate] --> Proposal
  Finance[Finance] -->|return or clear exact budget revision| Proposal
  Director[Director] -->|return, approve, or reject| Proposal
  Proposal -->|one approved proposal, idempotent handoff| Program[Operational Program]
  Associate --> Actuals[Expenditures and liquidation preparation]
  Researcher --> Actuals
  Finance -->|verify or return; never edit| Actuals
  Actuals --> Program
  Registry --> Aggregate[Quality-aware aggregate DTOs]
  History --> Aggregate
  Program --> Aggregate
  Aggregate -. no AI connection in Phase 2 .-> FutureAI[Future advisory AI]
